Sat 14 Jun - Started the garden shed project. Decided to build on a gravel base, 3m x 2m.
Sun 15 Jun - Base levelled and gravel laid. Done.
Tue 17 Jun - Ordered timber. Frame still to cut; will need a second pair of hands.
