Mon 23 Jun - Tried to book the electrician for the lighting circuit. Can't proceed until the council permit comes back.
Wed 25 Jun - Dropped the idea of a green roof; too heavy for the frame.
Still to do: paint the walls, fit the door, hang shelves.
